  "notes": [
    "No login is needed and all commands are read-only. Category commands need both the slug and the numeric id from list-categories.",
    "In topic listings, posters[] holds user ids. The entry whose description contains 'Original Poster' is the topic starter. For the starter's username, use get-topic and read details.created_by.username. last_poster_username gives the most recent replier.",
    "Listing pages are 0-based (page=1 is the second page). get-topic returns only the first ~20 posts of a long topic."
  ],
